      "title": "A Summer Music Festival",
      "text": "Last weekend, I attended the annual Sun-Sound Music Festival. It (1) _____ place in a large park just outside the city. Thousands of people arrived early to find the best spot for the main stage. The atmosphere was incredible, and the weather was perfect for an outdoor event. I (2) _____ forward to seeing my favorite band for months, and they certainly didn't disappoint. They played all their biggest hits, and the crowd sang along to every word. There were also many food stalls (3) _____ delicious snacks from all over the world. I tried a spicy taco, which was amazing. Although it was very crowded, I didn't (4) _____ it because the music was so good. Many people stayed until late at night when the fireworks (5) _____. It was truly an unforgettable experience, and I am already planning to (6) _____ tickets for next year's festival as soon as they go on sale.",
